00:07:20,210 --> 00:07:54,550
三，短文理解。你。将听到一篇短文，短文后有五个小题，请根据短文内容，在每小题所给的三个选项中选出一个最佳选项。

84
00:07:56,540 --> 00:07:59,240
Today is Father's Day.

85
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:03,160
I'm going to tell you something about my father.

86
00:08:03,860 --> 00:08:07,680
He is a teacher and he is 40 years old.

87
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:13,240
In the morning, he usually gets up early and makes breakfast.

88
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:17,380
After breakfast, he drives me to school.

89
00:08:17,780 --> 00:08:20,240
It takes us about 20 minutes.

90
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:22,860
Then he goes to work.

91
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:29,980
Late in the afternoon, he comes back home and cooks dinner together with my mother.

92
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:37,080
After dinner, my father helps me with my homework, especially math.

93
00:08:37,900 --> 00:08:41,240
Because of him, I like math very much.

94
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:47,760
In the evening, we enjoy reading together for about 30 minutes.

95
00:08:48,580 --> 00:08:52,220
He loves reading and I love reading too.

96
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:57,040
At the weekend, we usually go to the library.

97
00:08:57,040 --> 00:09:03,380
My father loves music and I'm becoming interested in music too.

98
00:09:04,260 --> 00:09:07,080
My father influences me a lot.

99
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,940
Thank you, Dad!

100
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:11,300
Happy Father's Day!

