00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:51,250
You Sharing usually means enjoying something with others.

120
00:10:51,250 --> 00:11:05,010
你将听到一篇短文，请根据短文内容写出下面表格中所缺的单词每空仅填一词，短文读两遍。

121
00:11:11,760 --> 00:11:15,220
It's important to learn how to share,

122
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:18,820
so let's take a look at the reasons.

123
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:23,800
helps us to make friends.

124
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:30,440
It helps others to feel cared about and shows that we are kind and friendly.

125
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:35,080
These are the things that we look for in a friend.

126
00:11:35,860 --> 00:11:39,700
Secondly, sharing teaches us how to be fair.

127
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:44,380
You can't take all things just because you love them.

128
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:50,140
And you don't need to give up all things just because someone else wants them.

129
00:11:51,020 --> 00:11:55,260
You should think about the needs of other people and your own.

130
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:59,540
Lastly, sharing gives us a sense of purpose.

131
00:12:00,380 --> 00:12:06,000
It means doing something meaningful for others and makes us feel good about

132
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:12,960
ourselves. Sharing really is caring about others and ourselves.

